  "definition": "Horizons are raw Insert-Peg actions. SMWM consumes them in blocks of five, so one raw action is not a model prediction. Autoregressive predictions start from the true first frame. Teacher predictions encode the true frame at the previous block boundary and predict one block. Goal costs compare a prediction with the encoded 25-step goal image. The 25-step physical success is the saved evaluator outcome.",
